WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Meet Pip. Start the circuit.
Pip moves, aims and fires on its own.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:34.000
TIME CUT - First victory. Choose Long Barrel.
More reach. A different way to fight.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:50.000
TIME CUT - Click ground to move. Click a rival to target.
Pip keeps its route and keeps firing.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TIME CUT - The Chief, later in the same run.
The aim corridor warns of a coming burst.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:29.000
TIME CUT - Five encounters. One proud machine.
Start a new run to try a different build.
